  "contentHtml": "<p>제가 만든 건 아니고 인천과학교사 모임 자료고 오래된 것이지만&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e3e089192bbdd35bf96316b201fc0c44730fcda3?download\" data-file-name=\"잎의단면만들기.pdf\" data-file-size=\"9232547\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1175%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20230622162535&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fe3e089192bbdd35bf96316b201fc0c44730fcda3')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">잎의단면만들기</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">8.80MB</div></div></a></div><p>저는 자주 사용하는 것입니다.&#160;&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>준비물 : A4용지, 사인펜, 색연필, 투명테이프, 가위 등</p><p>차시 : 1차시 ~ 2차시 (저는 1차시만 해서 완성도가 좀 떨어졌어요. 시간이 생각보다 오래 걸리더라구요)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/783f895db943aca92de9f3b616969bd1ec574779\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/783f895db943aca92de9f3b616969bd1ec574779\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><p>도화지보다 A4용지로 출력해서 투명테이프로 붙이는 것이 더 좋아요.&#160;</p><p>(풀이 생각보다 안 붙고 잘 떨어집니다)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>잘했든 못했든 학급 전체 학생의 모든 작품을 연결해서 숫자로 표현해 보았어요.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학기말에 할 것 없을 때 한 번 해 보세용.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e2fd0f6cb627bc65018028c8a843e2c1eabee26\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e2fd0f6cb627bc65018028c8a843e2c1eabee26\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50b41bc62fb792b2b38922a1060744adb76410aa\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/50b41bc62fb792b2b38922a1060744adb76410aa\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"1280\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
